  "stageId": "main_03-01",
  "title": "Meeting",
  "storyCode": "3-1",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6592a99b429f20bfae4bf5dc9eab138491b2e1363008eec0d3c5482809cc4f72",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十三关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Looks like you had a rough time as well.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Madam Ch'en, what happened here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "We were ambushed by Reunion.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "We were caught in a withering assault with no reinforcements. They easily routed our forces.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "And Misha...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "She was taken away by a woman dressed in red.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "I really should have...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Nevermind.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Madam Ch'en, why is Misha so special?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "If you keep hiding things from us, it's only going to be harder and harder for us to continue working together.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "I have no obligation to tell you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "But Rhodes Island has an obligation to understand the objectives and prepare our strategies accordingly.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Naturally, we'll continue to follow the L.G.D.'s instructions during our operations...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "However, when it comes to using the Infected to fight other Infected, we need all the information we can get.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "While you may have that information, you don't have the means of using it effectively to reduce your losses.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "On the other hand, we have the ability to stop Reunion, but we don't know what they're after.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "You sounded a bit like that doctor just now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Is, is that so...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I think...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "This is something that is equally important to both of us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "I see.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "If it's because you need to ask for permission from Chief Wei...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "When we investigated Misha, the most prominent bit of information was that her father was one of Chernobog's most influential people.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Misha's father?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Naturally, we don't know how much Misha knows about Chernobog.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "She could know nothing, or she could know everything.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Nobody knows...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "...except her.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "We also have no idea what kind of information she might have.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Since you predicted that Lungmen would be Reunion's next target...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "It's obvious that we have to prevent Reunion from using Chernobog.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "That's why we can't allow them to have Misha.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "We were aware of the fact that someone who fit her descriptions had taken refuge in Lungmen...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "But until you actually found her, we weren't able to verify if that intel was accurate.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "If that's the case, we can't waste any more time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We have to stop Reunion and rescue Misha before they're able to take her back to Chernobog!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Rhodes Island, prepare to move out!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "It was the L.G.D.'s responsibility to track her down.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "...and letting Reunion capture her was a dereliction of our duties.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Rather than lauching a joint operation, we'll need Rhodes Island to eliminate other threats from Reunion.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "This is an order.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...Understood.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Don't let me down.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "N-no! D-don't beat me...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "You should've thought twice before entering Lungmen!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Aaaagh!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Lock them all up!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "They're not with this group of Infected. Curses...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Not with this group either... Damn it all...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "They... retreated way too quickly...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "It seems that Reunion also has its own hierarchy.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "They just left the riffraff behind to buy them more time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "To think that a single person could delay our reinforcements...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Just who are they...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "Madam! We found some Reunion stragglers over there!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Follow me!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "Be careful, Madam Ch'en!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "It's an ambush!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "G-go to hell!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Don't get in my way--!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "Madam Ch'en, we're still on Lungmen soil!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "The nearby facilities can still be used, so please try not to cause too much damage!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Shut up already!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "At least, don't cut these buildings to pieces!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Th-this woman...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "She's so hard to deal with!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "...Hard to deal with?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Foolish Infected...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Did you think we'd allow you filth to treat Lungmen like your personal latrine?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "L.G.D., attack!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
